/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-13-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-14-  // Compare's right operand sits under the CmpOp wrapper — contexts instead of attributes
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-15-  context Compare(HOLE, _)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-16-  context Compare(_:Val, CmpOp(_, HOLE))
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k:17:  rule <k> Compare(LV:Val, CmpOp(OP:String, RV:Val)) => applyCmp(OP, LV, RV) ... </k> [owise]
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-18-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k:19:  rule applyCmp("is",     V:Val, noneV) => V ==K noneV
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k:20:  rule applyCmp("is not", V:Val, noneV) => notBool (V ==K noneV)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-21-
