/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-23-  // (Python: list == is structural; identity only via `is`.) priority(40)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-24-  // preempts the generic dispatch so applyUn/applyBin/applyCmp never see a ref.
