/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-92-  rule normIdxD(I:Int, _:Int)   => I          requires I >=Int 0
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-93-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-94-  // ==== dict == (order-insensitive: same size + same key->value pairs) =======
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k:95:  rule applyCmp("==", dictV(KS1:ValSeq, VS1:ValSeq), dictV(KS2:ValSeq, VS2:ValSeq))
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-96-    => (vsLen(KS1) ==Int vsLen(KS2)) andBool dSubset(KS1, VS1, KS2, VS2)
