/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-98-  rule dSubset(.ValSeq, .ValSeq, _:ValSeq, _:ValSeq) => true
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-99-  rule dSubset(vCons(K:Val, KR:ValSeq), vCons(V:Val, VR:ValSeq), KS2:ValSeq, VS2:ValSeq)
